{{!-- 04's Vengeful Blood in a one-handed weapon in each hand, offered (D-1017): *once a round,
      when a creature within your reach damages you with a melee attack, you may make your
      Off-Hand Attack for the round against it as a Reaction*. Posted from the attack card's
      Apply on the GM's client (`effects/death-knight-talents.mjs#offerVengefulRiposte`), so the
      button carries the knight: `data-reaction-owner` shows it to whoever owns the knight and
      nobody else (D-779), and the press judges the offer, the grip, the reach, the Reaction and
      the round's Off-Hand Attack again (`vengefulRiposteFromCard`). --}}
<div class="azeroth azeroth-card azeroth-card-feature" data-message-kind="vengefulOffer">
  <div class="azeroth-card-body">
    <p class="azeroth-card-line azeroth-fired"><span>{{name}}</span><em>{{text}}</em></p>
    <div class="azeroth-card-actions" data-reaction-owner="{{holderUuid}}">
      <button type="button" data-action="vengefulRiposte" data-holder-uuid="{{holderUuid}}" data-target-uuid="{{targetUuid}}">{{label}}</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
